If you use `selectize = TRUE` then you do get the order in which values were selected. You probably knew that already though since you explicitly want `selcetize=FALSE`.

In that case you're just using the default select input that is generated by the browser. And from my experience and from some very limited research, it seems that browsers send the value in the order of rendering. http://stackoverflow.com/questions/10446796/order-of-selection-in-html-select-multiple

